stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WAITING
    WAITING --> READY: socket accepted
    READY --> HANDSHAKE: handshake message accepted\n(FIND / JOIN / CREATE / JOIN_CODE)
    HANDSHAKE --> SIGNALING: authenticated and\nmatch assigned
    SIGNALING --> TERMINATED: socket closed,\nLEAVE, or error
    READY --> TERMINATED: error
    HANDSHAKE --> TERMINATED: error
    TERMINATED --> [*]

    note right of TERMINATED
        Absorbing. Further inbound
        messages are logged and dropped.
    end note
